  "prompt": "The function\n[Figure 1]\nis defined by\n[Figure 2]\n, where\n[Figure 3]\nis a constant. If the function has two distinct zeros\n[Figure 4]\nand\n[Figure 5]\nsuch that\n[Figure 6]\n, what is the value of\n[Figure 7]\n?",
